Lexicon sources and historical attribution claims.
The project's MIT license does NOT relicense third-party data or the compiled
lexicon. This inventory is not redistribution clearance. data/sources.json
records current file hashes and unresolved provenance. A release containing unresolved historical data is blocked until its exact
upstream versions, attribution and combination conditions are verified.
Canonical license texts are in LICENSES/; their presence does not prove that a
particular historical file is covered by that license.

