data/extra.txt
    Additional words and higher counts for words the subtitle list ranked
    too low. Counts come from 雾凇拼音 and the AOSP PinyinIME dictionary.
    A word is kept when it is at least 5% as common as the best word of
    the same spelling. If that spelling is also a single character, the
    word stays just below that character.

    雾凇拼音 cn_dicts/base.dict.yaml, cn_dicts/ext.dict.yaml, and
    cn_dicts/tencent.dict.yaml.
    Copyright the rime-ice authors.
    License: GPL-3.0-only.
    https://github.com/iDvel/rime-ice
    base.dict.yaml merges, among other lists, 华宇野风系统词库 (public domain),
    清华大学开源词库 THUOCL (MIT), and 腾讯词向量 (CC BY 3.0).
    ext.dict.yaml adds longer words, including entries from 简化字八股文
    (rime/rime-essay-simp, LGPL-3.0).
    tencent.dict.yaml is the Tencent AI Lab word embedding list (CC BY 3.0),
    arranged by rime-ice. Readings are the single rime-ice character reading
    that holds at least 5% of that character's weight. Words with more than
    one such reading are left out. These added words score 1, so a fuller
    spelling can still find them without passing the words already ranked
    from subtitles, base, and AOSP.

